      "writtenOn": "2023-04-17T06:15:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Assuming they are contiguous (which happens to be true in this case - swiotlb is laid immediately after main memory range), I think CrosVM can merge the regions into one. Let me submit a change into CrosVM and check for feedback.",
      "parentUuid": "f890a6bf_57d16858",
